    "title": "Creatinine Rise on TDF",
    "message": "The patient's creatinine has risen from a baseline of 0.8 mg/dL to 1.1 mg/dL after 10 weeks on a TDF-containing regimen (TLD), with a corresponding eGFR of 78 mL/min/1.73m2. TDF is a known cause of renal impairment. However, pregnancy itself can cause physiological changes in renal function and serum creatinine. The absence of proteinuria on urinalysis is reassuring but does not rule out drug-related toxicity.",
